    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSNL Junior Telecom Officer JTO Recruitment 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-06T10:54:57+05:30\"\u003eJune 6, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:54 am\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://bsnl.co.in/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eBharat Sanchar Nigam Limited (BSNL)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released a \u003cstrong\u003enotification \u003c/strong\u003eon its \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the recruitment of \u003cstrong\u003eJunior Telecom Officer (JTO)\u003c/strong\u003e Posts\u003cstrong\u003e.\u003c/strong\u003e This recruitment is for \u003cstrong\u003e100 positions.\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003eBSNL\u003c/strong\u003e application form has started on \u003cstrong\u003e04 June 2026,\u003c/strong\u003e and candidates can apply until\u003cstrong\u003e 03 July 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e The minimum age is \u003cstrong\u003e20 Years \u003c/strong\u003e\u0026amp; the maximum age is\u003cstrong\u003e 30 years as on 03 July 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e Candidates must check the complete details for the \u003cstrong\u003eBSNL Junior Telecom Officer JTO Recruitment 2026 \u003c/strong\u003eprovided below. \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(Advt. No. BSNLCO-14/1